1
00:00:12,288 --> 00:00:18,236
Ma charge de travail a tellement augmenté que je rentre épuisée tous les soirs.
My workload has increased so much that I come home exhausted every evening.

2
00:00:18,336 --> 00:00:23,252
À force de travailler tard, tu risques le surmenage.
By dint of working late, you risk overwork.

3
00:00:23,352 --> 00:00:31,028
Je suis fatiguée au point de ne plus pouvoir me concentrer. J'ai du mal à déconnecter.
I'm tired to the point of no longer being able to concentrate. I find it hard to switch off.

4
00:00:31,128 --> 00:00:36,380
Il faudrait que tu prennes du recul et que tu en parles à ton responsable.
You should take a step back and talk to your manager about it.

5
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:43,268
Je sais. Je me suis sentie tellement dépassée que je n'ai pas osé en parler.
I know. I felt so overwhelmed that I didn't dare to talk about it.

6
00:00:43,368 --> 00:00:50,324
Tu as le droit de demander de l'aide. Et mieux vaut le faire avant que la fatigue s'installe.
You have the right to ask for help. And it's better to do it before the exhaustion sets in.
